@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"

Feature: WWW Contact Sales
	Frontend testing for the www contact sales page

Scenario: View Contact Sales Page
	End users should be able to view the contact sales page and form.

	Given I go to the www homepage
	And I click on the Contact Sales button
	Then I should be able to view the Contact Sales page and form

Scenario: Request sales contact via contact sales form
	End users should be able to fill and submit the contact sales form.

	Given I go to the www homepage
	And I click on the Contact Sales button
	And I should be able to view the Contact Sales page and form
	And I request a sales contact with the following values
	| Work Email                         | usr.contactsales1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Country                            | United States                           |
	| State/Territory                    | California                              |
	| What would you like to talk about? | Test request sales contact              |
	| First Name                         | USR                                     |
	| Last Name                          | ContactSales1                           |
	| Company                            | Cosales                                 |
	| Phone                              | 555-555-5678                            |
	| Industry                           | Technology                              |
	And I wait for "5" seconds
	Then I should be able to view a message stating that the contact sales form was sent
	And the current url content should contain the text "contact-sales/thank-you"